cairo-qml-clock (0.1.0-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release
  * Fix: Properties and Info dialogs now movable on KDE Plasma 6 Wayland
    (changed window flag from Qt.Dialog to Qt.Window)
  * Fix: Right-click context menu now dismisses on click-outside on both
